---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/urls";
---
<BaseLayout title="Get Involved" description="Ways to volunteer, attend meetings and support The Friends of Ashley.">
  <PageHero wideTitle eyebrow="Everyone is welcome" title="Small help makes a real difference." intro="From helping at a uniform sale to looking after event equipment, there are lots of ways to support The FOA. Meetings are informal and open to parents, carers and staff." />
  <section class="content-section content-section--compact" aria-labelledby="volunteering-title">
    <div class="site-width">
      <article class="vacancy-card"><div class="vacancy-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Role vacancy</p><h2>Could you be our next <span class="co-secretary">Co-Secretary?</span></h2><p>A light, termly role that one person can do or two can share: agendas, minutes and keeping our paperwork in order. Sarah Parish and Katy Furber, the outgoing Secretaries, are happy to have a quick chat first.</p></div><div class="vacancy-actions"><a class="button button--dark" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=The%20FOA%20Co-Secretary%20role&amp;body=Hello%20The%20FOA%20team%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20the%20Co-Secretary%20role.%0A%0AThanks%2C">Ask about the role</a><a class="button button--secondary" href={withBase("/committee/")}>Meet the committee</a></div></article>
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Lend a hand</p><h2 id="volunteering-title">Find your way to help.</h2><p>You don't have to join the committee or lead an event to make a difference. Tell us what interests you and we'll put you in touch with the right team.</p></div>
      <div class="link-grid volunteering-grid">
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Pre-loved uniform sales</h3><p>Help the pre-loved team at sales, raising funds while passing good uniform on to another Ashley family.</p><p><a class="button button--secondary" href={withBase("/uniform/")}>See how uniform sales work</a></p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Quartermasters</h3><p>Join the team that maintains The FOA's event equipment and helps with event set-up. From BBQs and marquees to fencing and sheds, this behind-the-scenes work keeps our events running. New joiners are welcome.</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Event comperes</h3><p>Comfortable on a microphone? The compere team is looking for more volunteers to help with announcements and music at school events.</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Eco Stall lead</h3><p>The AGM identified a vacancy for someone to lead the Eco Stall, selling the small amount of stock The FOA holds at events. Get in touch to ask about taking it on.</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Event helpers</h3><p>Offer a hand with stalls, games and crafts at community events, or ask how you can support the organisers. Rachel and Sophie are leading this year's Christmas Fayre.</p><p><a class="button button--secondary" href={withBase("/whats-on/")}>See what's on</a></p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Smaller fundraisers</h3><p>Interested in Happy Bags, Christmas cards or class fundraisers? Ask the committee how you can support these activities or share an idea of your own.</p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Fireworks shadowing</h3><p>Shadow Helen at Fireworks 2026 and learn how to lead the event in 2027, with no pressure.</p><p><a class="button button--secondary" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=Shadowing%20Helen%20at%20Fireworks%202026&amp;body=Hello%20The%20FOA%20team%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20shadowing%20Helen%20at%20Fireworks%202026.%0A%0AThanks%2C">Offer to shadow Helen</a></p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Lead a community event</h3><p>The AGM invited individuals or small groups to lead the Summer Fete and Big Picnic. Plans and dates are still to be confirmed; ask the committee about getting involved.</p><p><a class="button button--secondary" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=Leading%20an%20event%20with%20The%20FOA">Ask about leading an event</a></p></article>
        <article class="info-card"><h3>Be a class rep</h3><p>Share messages from The FOA with your class group and help keep families informed.</p><p><a class="button button--secondary" href={withBase("/reps/")}>Visit the Reps Hub</a></p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="vacancy-actions volunteering-enquiry"><a class="button button--primary" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=Volunteering%20with%20The%20FOA">Tell us how you'd like to help</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
